WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.880
Someone once said...

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:55.020
There are plump, steaming-hot, 
chukaman mantas...

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:59.060
Chukamanta!

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:02.460
There are transparent cherries

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:06.570
that become visible when 
they turn ripe and sweet...

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:10.540
Hide-and-Seek Cherries!

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:14.140
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:20.150
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.550
The menu isn't decided yet?!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.820
The restaurant is reserved for today.
 Restaurant Gourmet

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:26.190
The Summit's celebration,

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.990
the "Great Job, Everyone Party", 
is the day after tomorrow!

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:30.520
I'm sorry.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:34.660
It's just, I haven't been able to 
come up with anything for the menu...

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:36.930
How about this, Bureau Chief Uumen?

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:39.670
We could serve Century Soup at the party...

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.500
You're naive, General Manager!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:46.570
Naive and sweet as shortcake drenched 
in syrup and then covered in sugar!

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:48.910
My apologies for having 
such a sweet, naive idea!

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:52.650
Listen. They would expect 
the chef's Century Soup.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.250
We need a dish with more impact!

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.150
Right...

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.750
Yo, Komatsu!

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.350
Toriko-san!

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.420
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.690
Hey, there's this totally delicious food

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:07.460
that can only be eaten this time of year.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:08.490
Wanna go an' chow down on some?

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:09.930
I knew it!

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.530
Sure, I'll go!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.530
You're going?!

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:20.010
Um... It may give me a hint about the menu...

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.510
Uh... See you later!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.710
Wait!

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.510
When he gets like that, nothing can stop him.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:37.050
Surpass Dad! Midsummer Gobbling Katsu Curry!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:55.070
Terry's gotten so big...

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.640
And the Obasaurus is here, too...

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.810
You really have to reserve a car 
on the Gourmet Train for them, huh?

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.310
Not just one car!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.750
I've got the whole train reserved.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.620
Now that's luxury!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.390
Buono lent it to me.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.290
Buono?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:16.160
You mean Buono-san, the multi-millionaire?

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.730
Yeah. He said to have a fun trip.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.200
Really?

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.370
The smell of salt...

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:26.770
We're almost there.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:29.110
We're going to the sea this trip?

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:30.140
Then...

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:32.340
It's probably a sea of lava,

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.740
or a sea with really nasty weather,

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:40.350
or a sea teeming with Beasts...

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:44.120
What kind of dangerous pattern 
is it going to be this time?

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.050
Look, you can see it.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.060
The sea!

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.530
The sea!

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:02.900
I never imagined it would 
be a seaside resort town!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.870
And with a delicious beach...

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.540
Gourmet Beach!

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.650
For two weeks in the summer 
here at Gourmet Beach,

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:22.160
100 kilometers of shoreline is crowded 
with food stalls and beach houses.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:26.760
You can even surf from delicious 
shop to shop, eating along the way.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.100
This beach is a heaping helping of fun!

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.330
Is that... Toriko and Komatsu-kun?!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.840
This is my chance at a scoop!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:40.440
This place is packed, huh?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.810
It's probably better that Terry 
and the rest didn't come.

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.710
Yeah. They're having plenty 
of fun bathing in the sea

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.810
at a Gourmet Secret Spot along the 
shore where people don't roam.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:51.280
Anyway, we can bring 'em some delicious 
Gourmet Beach grub later on.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:51.990
Right!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.950
So you two are here as well, eh?

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:57.760
That voice...

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:59.760
Here. I'm right here!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.030
Komatsu-kun!

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:03.200
Setsuno-san?!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.860
Granny Setsu!

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:10.600
Well? Sexy swimsuit, isn't it?

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.110
At any rate, I'm here today...

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.510
...with Jiro-chan on vacation.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:28.150
A drink after a sandstorm 
really hits the spot.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.090
Knocking Master Jiro!

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:33.560
Toriko-kun! Long time no see!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:38.830
U-Um... Thank you!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:39.930
For what?

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:43.670
I don't know how to adequately thank you

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.540
for going to save Toriko-san 
in the Gourmet World!

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.370
Komatsu...

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:52.040
Oh, I already forgot about all that.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.450
Hey, isn't that Toriko?!

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.550
Yeah! Gourmet Hunter, Toriko!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:07:01.050
Hey, look! Gourmet Living National 
Treasure Setsuno-sama is here, too!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.550
W-What the...?!

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.460
It's not a doll, but the real thing!

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.460
H-H-H-Hey!

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.000
That's enough!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.430
Everyone, back off!

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.530
Stay away from Toriko!

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:18.640
Go away!

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.110
Get outta here, I said!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.640
Ow... Rin-san?!

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:27.840
You are here!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.710
What are you doing here?!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.950
Toriko, you come here to eat 
the same thing every year,

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.520
so I figured you'd show up!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.690
Maybe that's the ingredient we're after now?!

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.820
Oh, don't be in such a rush.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.590
First, let's take a stroll around the beach.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.200
Welcome, one and all! Delicious 
vegetable bar here!

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.300
You can eat fresh fruit and 
vegetables at this place.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:54.400
So, what can I break off for you?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.270
Let's see...

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.770
Isn't that Melody Cucumber?!

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.240
Pops! I'll have one of those!

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.210
Sure!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.680
When you bite into this thing, 
it gives off a nice sound!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.060
What fun!

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:16.420
And it tastes like melon, 
so it's sweet and delicious!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.030
You can't go to the beach and not have ramen!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.860
It's got fresh ones inside!

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.230
Fresh ramen?

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.400
I mean them!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.600
Ramen Octopus!

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:29.940
Here you are. Thanks for waiting!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.670
Oh, yeah! It looks just like ramen!

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.950
I can't get enough of this sensation!

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:47.790
What refreshing sweetness!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.020
This Dragonfly Sherbet is the best!

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:53.060
It feels great to cool off.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.700
Come one, come all! Gather 'round to watch!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.930
This is so delicious, electricity 
will run through your body!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.770
It's the Volt Fugu dissecting show!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.770
Please, go ahead!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:12.610
Here.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:13.710
Okay!

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:17.480
Ta-daa!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.820
What kind of shop should we go to next?

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:25.360
There are so many, I can't decide!

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:27.590
They've got Perotto over there, too...

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.960
They're so popular...

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:36.100
Well, why don't we move 
on to today's main course?

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:39.400
What is it?!

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:42.010
A beach house, Gobbling Katsu Curry!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:45.840
Certainly, you couldn't mistake 
this for anything but a curry shop!

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:50.720
But... it looks like it's closed...

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:55.450
I thought something was strange 
ever since we hit Gourmet Beach...

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.920
It was because I didn't 
catch even a whiff of curry.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.390
Your nose is as impressive as ever.

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:02.760
Toriko!

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.130
Tina-san! Kuruppo!

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:09.030
What are you doing?!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.470
I finally found you!

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.070
What is it, Toriko?!

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.970
What kind of Gourmet ingredient 
did you come here to eat today?!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:16.940
A few words, please!

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.080
Forget it!

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:19.940
This is totally private!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.610
Toriko and I are here to appreciate the sea!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.650
Toriko!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.450
Toriko-san!!

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:30.050
You...

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.120
Cumin!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:34.090
This is the son of the shop's owner.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:35.990
I-I-It's awful!

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.760
My old man went...

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:40.200
The curry went out to sea!

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:44.030
Please help me!

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:01.680
It looks like he finally calmed down.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.090
Hey. What happened to your dad?

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:08.220
Last month, he suddenly passed away.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:11.830
Your dad... died?!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:17.530
And then, the shop was passed down 
to me and my little sister, Saffra.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:21.770
I became the cook and Saffra 
became a Gourmet Hunter.

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:24.340
So you siblings partnered up...

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:30.650
Yes. Saffra set out to sea to capture 
ingredients, but she hasn't returned!

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:32.610
Even though two days have passed!

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:36.350
She was really worked up about 
bringing back Dad's curry,

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:38.090
so I'm worried about her...

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.120
Bringing back the curry?

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:45.790
Right now, I can't make Dad's curry!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.100
Don't tell me... you ran out of roux?!

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.130
No. I have roux.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.040
That's...

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.170
Curry Comet roux.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:01.440
Curry Comet is the legendary comet

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:05.050
that is said to come to 
earth once every 99 years.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:10.050
Flying through the vacuum of space 
for many years deepens the flavor,

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:13.050
which is said to be astronomically delicious!

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:17.060
My dad captured the Curry 
Comet that fell to earth

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.930
and simmered roux that 
was inside of it in a pot

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:21.630
that he fashioned from a piece of the comet,

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.530
adding to it, adding to it, 
keeping the shop going this way.

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:27.130
If you've got roux, you should use it.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:30.740
This curry is a Special 
Preparation Ingredient.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.070
The ingredients I have here would 
lose to the flavor of the roux,

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:35.440
which has a punch.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.110
I've been trying my best!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.610
Hold on, hold on!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:42.080
You always used to help your dad, didn't you?

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:45.480
Not really. I was in training, and my 
work was to give water to customers,

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:47.190
dish out the curry, and so on.

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:51.020
My dad never told me the recipe.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:53.460
He worked really hard to 
come up with the recipe,

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.400
so there was no way he would 
share it, even with me, his son.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.430
What a terrible father!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.670
I don't see it that way.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:07.970
Your father used those 
cooking utensils, didn't he?

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:09.110
Yes.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.940
I can tell by looking at them...

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:14.810
They were all handled with care.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.850
I think your father must have 
been a wonderful person.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:22.850
Your father probably had a reason 
for not sharing the recipe with you.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.820
That old man had no reason!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.130
But more importantly, my sister!

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:31.260
Please find my sister, Saffra!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:33.030
Please, I'm begging you!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.730
Alright. Leave Saffra to me.

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.770
No, not only Saffra.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:40.500
Along the way, I'll also get the 
ingredients you need for your curry.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.270
So make delicious curry for us, Cumin!

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:46.310
You're in charge of preparing the food.

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.780
Toriko-san!

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:51.010
In that case, you'll need transportation!

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.380
Tom-san!

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:57.090
I thought I'd stop here for lunch, and 
couldn't believe it when it was closed.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:59.720
The only thing to do is give you guys a lift!

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.460
Looks like they're having a blast swimming.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:03.460
Gastro Gig

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:05.190
Oba, you want to stay here a while longer?

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.600
I hope it'll turn out alright...

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.300
There's nothing to worry about.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:13.900
Not with Toriko and Komatsu-kun...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:16.940
Anyway, if your father's 
curry does make a comeback,

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:20.740
I'll get a human interest story scoop.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.780
Believe in everyone and do your best!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.550
Right! Okay, first, I'll polish the rice!

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.350
It's hot in here...

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:36.630
Um... What kind of curry was 
Cumin-san's father's curry?

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:39.090
It was a hearty helping of Katsu Curry.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.360
Various ingredients were 
melted into the curry,

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.600
so even I didn't know what they all were.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:47.500
But I'd know that juicy, young, 
fresh meat cutlet anywhere.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.000
It's from...

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.740
...a Water Tiger.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.210
Water Tiger...

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:57.810
It's an elusive Beast that's said 
to be filled with fish extract.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:01.120
People also say the Water 
Tiger can cross the sea,

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.450
though I haven't run across one yet.

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:06.690
It can cross the sea?

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.520
Toriko! Something's coming!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:11.390
Those are...

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.030
Porcupine Chips!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:15.560
They're porcupine fish that taste 
delicious, like potato chips!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.570
A potato snack?! I'll eat that!

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:20.070
I'll catch some, too!

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.700
I got a bunch!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:26.070
All-you-can-eat potato snacks!

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:29.140
But Porcupine Chips swim in deep sea water.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.080
They don't normally show themselves...

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.510
Ready... Go!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:33.780
Huh?

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:36.820
Komatsu!

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.020
Alright! I captured the Porcupine Chips!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.860
Saffra!

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:48.960
Toriko?!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.730
Who are you?!

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:53.100
Toriko-san!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:55.200
What's that?!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.040
It's still coming!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:09.780
That's a Smoke Salmon!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.820
I can hardly see anything!

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:15.350
Yeah. It belches up a curtain of smoke!

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:17.190
But it shouldn't be in 
this area of the ocean!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.130
Boy, is it stubborn!

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:27.030
Flying Knife!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.000
You missed?!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:31.700
Nope!

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.270
It's going exactly where I aimed for!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:34.570
I saw it!

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:37.910
Flying Fork!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.580
Are you okay, Saffra?!

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:45.650
Toriko!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.650
This is Saffra-san?!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:51.020
An Amphibious Beast... Bubble Knuckle...

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.460
Just Bubbu. My partner.

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:55.660
The question is, what are you doing here?

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.930
We came to get you.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:00.600
Cumin is seriously worried about you.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.730
And I bet he was bawling his 
eyes out again, too, huh?

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.470
Wha...?! Well, yeah...

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:05.170
Jeez...

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:08.370
If he's gonna cry, he ought to at 
least do it while chopping onions.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:11.040
She seems like a strong-willed person...

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:13.240
Toriko, give my big brother a message.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.250
Tell him I'm fine.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.980
Now, I'm busy, so...

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:17.710
Bubbu...

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.020
Hey!

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.120
Cryin' out loud... Alright, fine...

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:55.220
Wow, this Tapioclam is great!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.450
There are Matryoshclams, too!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:01.060
These ingredients are so rare, you never 
get to really see them at the market.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.930
With this, it'll be sweet! On the sweet side!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.690
I need to gather more ingredients 
that can be used to make curry.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.260
Especially the one ingredient I 
need more than anything else...

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.900
I don't have the Water Tiger yet.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.800
You intend to capture a Water Tiger?

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.570
You know where they are?!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.840
Yup.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:19.910
Why do you think I'm in this 
dangerous section of the sea?

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.710
Don't tell me they're here?!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.040
Okay, I won't tell you... Toriko.

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:34.520
That island is moving!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.760
But that's impossible!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.790
A horse's head coming from the island?!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:42.460
Even more impossible!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:43.860
That's...

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:48.070
It's a ocean-crossing horse that 
rides the current annually.

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:49.500
An Island Horse.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:54.040
A Water Tiger must be over there.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.740
Bubbu! Let's go!

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:59.110
So that's what it is to cross the ocean...

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:02.050
The Gastro Gig can't get alongside that.

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:04.520
Then wait in a slightly safer place.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:07.420
Terry! Let everyone ride you!

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.420
This is in the Island Horse...

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:20.530
There's a Water Tiger in here...

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:30.310
A Potacarronion Chicken!

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:32.440
Toriko-san!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.610
This guy looks really powerful!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.280
Consommenattoroast?!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.520
These are curry ingredients!

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:46.560
I thought it was weird that Dad only 
served curry during the summer.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:50.660
He must have gotten his curry 
ingredients from this island!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.330
Certainly, all of these 
ingredients are superb.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.730
The Porcupine Chips, the Smoke Salmon, too...

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:59.440
I bet the ingredients on 
this island drew us here.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:03.870
Um... That scary one's still staring...

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.550
Renge-san?

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:14.620
It's Zonge!

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:16.690
Don't scare me like that!

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:18.760
What are you doing here?!

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:22.930
We're on the run from that carriage.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:26.230
We were locked up in a storeroom 
of the Gourmet Carriage,

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:28.570
but successfully carried 
out a magnificent escape.

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:33.640
Then, as we were drifting in the sea, 
this island came along and saved us.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:36.740
The Gourmet Carriage... 
Then it's running nearby.

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:39.680
Zonge-sama has good luck with horses!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.310
I sure do!

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:43.980
But this is no time to talk!

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:46.050
Oh, that's right! A monster is coming.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.520
A monster?

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:49.520
You bet your ass...

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:53.990
That's...

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:17.380
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.220
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:25.950
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:28.790
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:31.630
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:34.460
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:37.200
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:40.000
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.700
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.370
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:45.810
and it'll be more and more

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:47.140
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:49.940
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:52.810
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:21:52.810 --> 00:21:57.080
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.420
Such a waste!

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.250
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:04.060
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:09.660
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:12.570
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:16.470
Gourmet News!

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:19.010
I'm your host, Tina.

00:22:19.610 --> 00:22:23.440
A heaping helping of ingredients suggested 
in the 2nd Gourmet Monster Contest

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:25.580
appeared in this episode.

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:27.880
Curry Comet.

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:29.880
Bubble Knuckle.

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:31.750
Island Horse.

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:33.750
Chukamanta.

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:35.750
Hide-and-Seek Cherries.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:37.760
Melody Cucumbers.

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:39.760
Ramen Octopus.

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:41.760
Dragonfly Sherbet.

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:43.760
Volt Fugu.

00:22:43.760 --> 00:22:45.760
Porcupine Chips.

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:47.770
Smoke Salmon.

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:49.770
Tapioclam.

00:22:49.770 --> 00:22:51.770
Matryoshclam.

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:53.770
Potacarronion Chicken.

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:55.770
Consommenattoroast.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:58.540
Thank you for participating, everyone.

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:02.080
What kind of Gourmet Monsters 
will appear next time?

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.050
And will Gobbling Katsu Curry be made?!

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:09.460
It's a parade of unique ingredients on display!

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:12.900
And the ultimate menu will include all of them in a single pot!

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:16.660
The Ties That Bind! Superb Gobbling Katsu Curry

00:23:16.940 --> 00:23:18.630
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
